WEBVTT

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:15.200
What's happening?

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:17.370
Who's going to Pure Illusion?

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:21.790
Stop it at once!

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.430
Who're you?

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:34.330
The third amorphous child.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.860
Her impedance with the twins is stable.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:38.430
Out of the way.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:39.990
You're useless now.

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:41.020
Not needed.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.770
Give me another chance! 
I won't fail this time!

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.350
One last chance.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.760
You'd better retrieve it this time.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.140
I will.

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:57.560
Take the amorphous they have, too.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:03.040
I know.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.570
My mindset is totally unlike theirs!

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.790
Time to dig in!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.450
Let's go again,

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:51.480
Mimi!

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:54.280
What's in it today?

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:55.730
Let's see...

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:59.450
Hamburg steak, French fries, broccoli...

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.880
Wow, everything but the kitchen sink.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:04.840
It's Papika's Special 
Hamburg Steak Plate Rice Ball!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.150
I made sure to put carrots in it, too.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.370
Okay, I get it.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.330
Want a bite?

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.060
You like sweet carrots, right?

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:14.630
I hate them!

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.420
Huh? But...

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:19.600
Who do you think I—

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.310
Let's eat.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:37.240
Cocona.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.080
Let's walk home together.

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:47.280
Adventuring with Cocona!

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:49.920
I hope we find another fragment!

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.030
Cocona?

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:56.250
You're making it hard to walk!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.670
But you're acting weird.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.460
You're the one being weird!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.750
Where should we go?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:05.010
Peep

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.500
There's a new place in...

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.230
You're not talking about anything,

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.620
and you even said you hate sweet carrots...

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:14.270
You're just mistaking me for someone else!

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.860
You really are acting weird.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.450
You're just way too self-centered.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.500
You never consider my—

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:29.410
You never consider the trouble 
you're putting others through!

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:32.910
Says the one who burned all the 
ovens in the Home Ec room!

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.190
Not all of them!

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.170
Trouble

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.430
Oh, dear.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.320
<i>You two!</i>

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.420
<i>Take this seriously!</i>

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:52.100
<i>Are you sure it's a good idea 
to send them like this?</i>

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.630
<i>It doesn't matter! They have to go!</i>

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.460
<i>They're probably fighting 
over something dumb!</i>

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.440
<i>Hey! They'll hear you!</i>

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.120
Damn it!

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:12.020
This one's a bust, too!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.550
Signal detected.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:16.810
Cocona and Papika?

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.380
Confirming coordinates.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:23.210
The amorphous is sure 
to be wherever they are.

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:24.820
Chance.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.260
Last one.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:28.620
Let's go.

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:37.810
What is this place?

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.940
White

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:39.920
It's empty.

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:45.780
Found it.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.170
Race ya!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.880
Wait, why?

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.310
First come, first served!

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:54.600
You know that's not what matters here!

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.960
You can just wait there, then.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.260
No fair!

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.480
Hold it!

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:07.010
Knock it off already.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.380
Quit being so difficult.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.050
You're the one being difficult.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:11.430
I am not!

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:22.610
Yayaka!

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:24.680
I'm so glad you're okay.

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.740
I was worried since you 
haven't been at school—

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.380
I keep telling you, you're too soft.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.120
I asked if you were prepared for 
what this entails, didn't I?

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.140
I am.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:38.610
Tch!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.000
Cocona!

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:01.940
We have to help Cocona!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.780
The twins will deal with the defense trap.

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:05.070
But...

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:17.410
Hand over the amorphous you have!

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:28.800
Why?

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:30.310
All brawn, no brain.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.050
You can't have the fragment!

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:36.220
Got it.

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:38.810
Can't be physically destroyed.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.170
Disarming method?

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.550
Will find it.

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:46.300
Papika.

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.320
Yayaka.

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:49.740
I said hand it over!

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.450
No! Our wishes won't come true without it!

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.320
Cocona...

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:57.580
So, what'll it be?

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:01.940
Run away!

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:02.990
Hey!

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:06.920
Where are they going?

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.760
Cocona-oneechan.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.010
What?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.510
Help

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.680
Propose ceasefire.

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:16.680
Danger

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:21.660
So, we'll agree not to attack each other?

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.680
Yeah. Until we leave this place.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:30.570
Help

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:29.140
Uh, tell me your names.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:29.910
Toto.

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:30.570
Yuyu.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.000
Toto and Yuyu, huh?

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:35.190
Got it.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:41.820
You believed.

00:08:42.150 --> 00:08:42.960
Softie.

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.170
You were lying?

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:46.540
Won't take the amorphous here.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.810
Pointless if we can't leave.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.420
Uh...

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.800
Don't take him apart too much.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:12.280
Still okay.

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:14.310
Funny.

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:15.030
Lively.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:19.660
Do you two have wishes you want to come true?

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:20.520
Nope.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:21.460
Nothing.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:24.030
Oh.

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:27.790
I wonder if Yayaka has one.

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.440
What a desolate place.

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.900
How long are you... gonna run?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:44.810
Until you stop... chasing me...

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.060
Hang on... Timeout...

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.480
I'm hungry...

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:55.570
Sniff, sniff.

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.510
I don't smell anything.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:03.190
Food!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:08.080
I don't mind trading it for the amorphous.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.080
The answer's still no!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:12.960
That so?

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:23.890
Man, this is good.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:29.700
Hey.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.050
Food!

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:34.800
Wha—

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:35.650
Why, you little...

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.150
Stop it! Lemme go!

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.260
What are they doing?

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:45.800
Yuyu!

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:48.200
Worried about the two outside?

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:52.390
We really should save Cocona first.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:54.010
How many times do I have to say it?

00:10:54.010 --> 00:10:55.420
The amorphous comes first.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.340
What are they talking about?

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:00.430
Food.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:02.020
You can tell?

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:03.840
Read their lips.

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:06.210
You can do that?

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:07.430
You can't?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:14.320
Papika doesn't seem worried about you.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:18.090
Only talking about food.

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.510
Also...

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.330
Talking about someone else.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.330
Papika...

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:37.660
Papika, you can just...

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:42.760
What's going on?

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:45.190
Cocona!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.560
I have to save Cocona!

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:58.650
I said no.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.230
Aren't you worried about her?

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:03.910
The amorphous takes priority.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.950
Cocona's more important!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.050
Shut up!

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:11.930
Her voice, her scent, and how 
she's so nice deep down...

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.960
I love everything about her!

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:25.500
You just showed up, like, yesterday.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:27.600
What do you know about Cocona?!

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:32.980
I've been with her since 
way before you met her!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:37.680
Papika.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:38.480
Yayaka.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.840
Reacting to Cocona-oneechan's emotions.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.050
Worried about Papika?

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:45.240
Or Yayaka?

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:49.120
I don't want them to fight.

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.160
Wait here, okay?

00:12:58.620 --> 00:12:59.350
Okay.

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:07.590
This place is always so depressing.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.630
All those tests are such a drag.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.770
They should just get 'em all done in one go.

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.520
Don't you agree?

00:13:18.280 --> 00:13:20.570
Uh, who are you?

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.280
Yayaka. And you?

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.280
Cocona.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.330
You've got tests now, too, right?

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:29.120
Yep.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.040
Don't those suck? They're such a pain.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.160
Yeah.

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:36.860
They stick those weird tubes in you.

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.040
For real?

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.840
They do that?

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:42.050
Will I have to go through that, too?

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:44.800
Oh, but it's okay!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.800
I was fine!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.580
Um, so you'll also...

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.180
You're a nice girl, huh?

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.140
You don't really wanna 
have them either, right?

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:00.760
Yeah.

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:01.880
All right.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:04.940
Wanna run away, then?

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:25.110
We can't run in the hallways!

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:26.200
This way!

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:36.550
Keep your head down!

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.330
They won't find us here.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:43.220
Won't we get in trouble for this?

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:46.220
You say that, but you seem to be having fun.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.340
One, two...

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:53.950
Cream bread!

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:53.950
Slimy soba!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:55.980
That's some grown-up taste.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:57.200
It is?

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.310
Okay, next we'll say the food we hate.

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:01.600
One, two—

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:13.260
Did you make a friend?

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:15.970
Yep!

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:23.480
Cocona!

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:25.820
Cocona!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.240
Cocona!

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.830
Cocona! Cocona!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.080
With such a weak mindset...

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:47.750
You don't deserve to be by Cocona's side!

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:00.010
Tch.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.900
Cocona! Cocona!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:05.650
Cocona!

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:07.520
Cocona!

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:21.250
Co...co...na!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:28.630
Papika!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.330
Cocona!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.440
Papika!

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:50.840
Well done.

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:53.920
Continue to monitor the target.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:59.550
Next to her is where you belong.

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:03.150
<i>Where I belong?</i>

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:12.630
Take amorphous from Cocona-oneechan.

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:15.020
Or lose your place again.

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.180
I know.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:37.910
Papika!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.160
Cocona!

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.090
All beat up.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.460
Can you beat us?

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:02.590
Transform.

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:03.960
But...

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:12.740
Didn't you say you were prepared?

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.910
Flip Flapping.

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:47.680
Ow

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.240
Said mindset was different, remember?

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:51.810
Right, Yayaka?

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:03.780
Stop it already, Yayaka!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:35.020
There's another one.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.360
Yayaka, don't!

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:08.360
Damn it!

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:11.560
Damn it! Damn it!

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.810
The weak mindset...

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:16.860
...is Yayaka's!

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:45.010
Yayaka?

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:02.650
Hurt.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:04.790
Securing amorphous takes priority.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.920
Yayaka...

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.270
Yayaka!

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.950
Hey, Yayaka!

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:13.450
Yayaka!

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:50.970
In Use

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:52.420
Don't worry.

00:22:52.420 --> 00:22:53.910
Leave the rest to us.

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:56.220
Please save her! She's my friend!

00:23:10.600 --> 00:23:11.510
Mimi...

00:23:13.100 --> 00:23:14.300
Mimi?!

00:23:14.300 --> 00:23:15.490
Where's Mimi?!

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:16.750
Hey, where's Mimi?!

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:18.410
Calm down, Papika!

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:19.640
What's wrong?

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:21.670
Who's Mimi?

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:23.720
Mimi's...

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:26.920
my partner!

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:40.940
Pure Jitter
